    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been imprisoned in the royal dungeon. Forced to participate in weekly gladiatorial combat, you will surely die unless you make some powerful friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your day-to-day life in the dungeon, date your fellow inmates (who are monsters) and fight by their side to survive and escape in this innovative time-management dating-sim RPG where every choice matters and every playthrough is different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live your day-to-day life as a prisoner in a dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully manage your time, for it is limited</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date your inmates, who are monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight by their side in gladiatorial combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to keep them alive...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or live with the consequences of your actions</p></li></ul>",
